# EAS Build archive excludes.
# Why this exists: 71 agent worktrees under .claude/worktrees/ (8.6GB, each with
# its own node_modules) pushed the archive 228MB -> 1.2GB and the upload 400'd.
# KEEP THIS CONSERVATIVE. A previous version globbed *.png and stripped the app
# icon/splash assets, which failed the Bundle JavaScript phase. Exclude only
# directories that cannot contribute to the app bundle.
#
# ANCHOR EVERY ROOT-LEVEL ENTRY WITH A LEADING SLASH. This file uses gitignore
# semantics, so a bare `screens/` matches a directory named `screens` at ANY
# depth — including `mobile/src/screens/`, i.e. every screen in the app. That
# is exactly what happened: builds 99 and 100 (v1.12.1) both died at Bundle
# JavaScript with "Unable to resolve module ../screens/SignInScreen", while
# `npx expo export` succeeded locally, because the failure only exists inside
# the archive. Second instance of this bug class in this file.
/.claude/worktrees/
/archive/
/staged-work/
/feedback-workspace/
/mockups/
/screens/
mobile/ios/build/
